# Line endings. This computer's Git is set to rewrite files with Windows line endings (core.autocrlf=true), which silently changed
# the bytes of files that were then deployed (staging, 2026-10-26: 56 static files became CRLF). These rules make every checkout, reset
# and worktree write LF for text files whatever the global setting is, so what is deployed is what is committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
